CORE broken-smt-backend no-new-smt
main.c
--smt2 --fpa --outfile -
^\(set-logic ALL\)$
\(_ FloatingPoint 8 24\)
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
QF_AUFBV
--
With the FPA theory, the formula uses floating-point sorts, which the
quantifier-free logic of arrays, uninterpreted functions and bit vectors
(QF_AUFBV) does not include: Z3 and cvc5 rejected the file ("unknown sort
'FloatingPoint'").
broken-smt-backend: the test inspects the generic output only.
